              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwut pipö kotï pöytoghin Yosia ompö atoni kïlenchï Yosia mötworichi, “Amïtante owan kikewutanïn kunyara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsïtunö Mötworichi nkari akumïta nkari anka kutang Yerusalem. Kïma Yosia ketïpchï wölo kikïtïpchï papotïnechi. Kïlokyö pipö Yuda löwïr nko cho pö Yerusalem ompö Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimïn werkoyonta Yeremia tum nyo pö lok paraku megha Yosia. Tumöy tumï löwïr cho le mïrön nko cho le kor, tumwöy cho ngölono Yosia tökwompö nyete le ye akegh kïlïkwï osïl pö pipö Israel, akukirote ompö kitapu tumwöyi lok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
